    {
      "id": "b2",
      "function": "problem",
      "scene_type": "gs_phases",
      "spoken": "In December 1879, the Tay Bridge collapsed. Work on the planned suspension bridge across the Forth was stopped, and in 1881 the plans were dropped. In 1883, construction of a steel cantilever bridge began.",
