      "function": "explanation",
      "scene_type": "gs_section",
      "spoken": "Three double cantilevers carry two suspended spans between them. Each of the two main spans is 518 metres, and the towers rise 110 metres above high water. It was built by the Glasgow firm of Arrol.",
